      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this could likely break placement of existing plugins: \n\nHeads-up: this changes DOM ordering for existing plugins even when **no** `order` is specified (`order \u003d\u003d\u003d undefined`).\n\nPreviously:\n- **Slotted components (`{slot: ...}`)**: `slotEl.parentNode.insertBefore(el, slotEl.nextSibling)` prepended each component right after `\u003cgr-endpoint-slot\u003e`, resulting in **reverse attachment order (LIFO)** (and reverse-alphabetical on initial load).\n- **Non-slotted components**: `this.appendChild(el)` appended components in **attachment order (FIFO)** for async/late registrations.\n\nBecause `shouldInsertBefore()` defaults `order` to `Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER` and unconditionally falls back to `meta.pluginName.localeCompare(pluginName) \u003e 0`, all unordered components on both slots and root endpoints now sort **alphabetically by `pluginName`** (reversing existing slotted LIFO order and changing async non-slotted registration order).",
